    "title": "SDTR's Kentucky Derby watch party | Cape Gazette",
    "text": "Share:\nSDTR’s Kentucky Derby watch party\nSDTR’s Kentucky Derby watch party, 4:30 to 7:30 p.m., 17170 Harbeson Rd., Milton. Proceeds benefit therapeutic riding center. Horses auction parade, best hat contest, hors d’oeuvres, open bar with mint juleps; cost is $75 per person. For tickets go to sdtrhr.com.\nEvent Details:\nEvent Date:\nSat, 05/02/2026 - 4:30pm to 7:30pm",
